eat opportunity to go  check that out and get what you need so  in summary the advanced assay that we  used to qualify our es qualified FBS was  designed to sustain  undifferentiated embryonic stem cells  while maintaining karyotype integrity  Lifford  responsiveness as well as pluripotency  markers and it has proven applications  in IPC generation and PSC culture  including reprogramming pluripotency  marker maintenance as well as  pluripotent stem cell morphology  maintenance  we also saw that adds superior  performance over competing products with  regard to morphology and especially  maintenance of pluripotency and there is  a newly designed aliquot free one-shot  version available now and able to get  free samples of that on our website so  thank you
 

